Subject: [PATCH] feat(apsara-gateway): complete Apsara gateway integration for frontend and backend

Backend:
- Add Apsara gateway DTO request/response entity classes (params & result)
- Rewrite ApsaraGatewayClient with full API support (MCP Server, Model API, Consumer CRUD, authorization)
- Remove deprecated ApsaraStackGatewayClient
- Implement ApsaraGatewayOperator: fetchMcpServers, fetchModelAPIs, fetchMcpConfig, fetchModelConfig, createConsumer, updateConsumer, deleteConsumer, isConsumerExists, authorizeConsumer, revokeConsumerAuthorization
- Fix AdpMCPServerResult to support Apsara SDK record conversion
- Clean up lib jars and update pom.xml dependencies

Frontend:
- Add ApsaraGatewayModelItem type for Model API support
- Fix ApiProductLinkApi: apsaraGatewayRefConfig handling for MCP Server and Model API, apigRefConfig exclusion logic, connection config useEffect, getServiceInfo display
- Fix ImportGatewayModal: pagination dispatches to correct fetch function per gateway type, fix JSON.parse fallback
- Fix EditGatewayModal: xAcsOrganizationId changed to optional field
---
